  "paragraphs": [
    "The gate will remain closed until morning, Iñés said. Lian placed Mei’s entry beside the lamp and read it again. The note asked for a minimum of three witnesses before anyone opened the inner court. Two parallel paths followed the river, where willow branches moved in the wind. He listened for the murmur beneath the bridge, then turned back to the ledger.",
